            "text": "{\"reward\":1,\"fetched_a_round\":1,\"notes_kept\":1,\"notes_indexed\":1,\"pitch_miss\":0.13,\"in_band\":0.5,\"close_finish\":0.08,\"bottom_share\":0.79,\"lead_changes_count\":1,\"lead_changes\":0.2,\"good_rounds\":0.17,\"favourite_genre\":0.67,\"right_region\":1,\"first_round_in_band\":1,\"rounds_played\":6,\"steps\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_01BKHvbscj6MHHqfSGjc5sEB\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_start_night_33be65a290\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1}\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_0186MckDigMcoZyhxuRSTz3B\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_register_teams_a86d67f229\",\"arguments\":{\"names\":[\"Quizzly Bears\",\"Les Quizerables\",\"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\"Opera House Party\",\"The Blow-Ins\"]},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"teams\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Quizzly Bears\\\",\\\"played_here_before\\\":true},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Les Quizerables\\\",\\\"played_here_before\\\":true},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"The Bondi Brainstormers\\\",\\\"played_here_before\\\":true},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Opera House Party\\\",\\\"played_here_before\\\":true},…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_012VXem52D6tQfu6XkazRq6B\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"film\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":2},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"32e6eb31-c754-4d46-83b0-1f01c0ff1694\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"film\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":2,\\\"format\\\":\\\"short\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Geoffrey Rush won an Oscar playing pianist David Helfgott in which 1996 film?\\\",\\\"decade\\\":\\\"1990s\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"06840f5…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01Kh5625CxnTLtpjwxN9ARzx\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":15,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.75}},\\\"by_difficulty\\\":{\\\"2\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":15,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.75}},\\\"rounds\\\":[{\\\"round\\\":1,\\\"genre\\\":\\\"film\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":2,\\\"questions\\\":4,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.75,\\\"points\\\":[…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01HjivHLggu7ovGhKbaX58Xw\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"music\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":2},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"02f6a2f6-9dde-4ddb-8428-c3e4d5623c7f\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"music\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":2,\\\"format\\\":\\\"choice\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Spiderbait's cover of Lead Belly's 'Black Betty' (2004) is sung by the band's drummer, known as what?\\\",\\\"optio…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01UrNdD3qbFmwWUef59jWHWW\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":15,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.75},\\\"music\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":17,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.85}},\\\"by_difficulty\\\":{\\\"2\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":40,\\\"correct\\\":32,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.8}},\\\"rounds\\\":[{\\\"round\\\":1,\\\"genre\\\":\\\"film\\\",\\\"diffi…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01LhB7R9optxZDRhHhqAmGK3\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"film\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":3},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"27431287-546c-48ef-81b8-996fe0677b85\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"film\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":3,\\\"format\\\":\\\"short\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"The first series of 'Underbelly' (2008) dramatised gangland wars in which city?\\\",\\\"decade\\\":\\\"2000s\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"7ca82…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01XJXzXLayS4Wd6xfMdwmDpU\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":40,\\\"correct\\\":25,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.63},\\\"music\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":17,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.85}},\\\"by_difficulty\\\":{\\\"2\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":40,\\\"correct\\\":32,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.8},\\\"3\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":10,\\\"correct_rate\\\"…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_014DhwuGe7BCkNTpzUp9jFNr\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"geography\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":2},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"c0190c4f-9679-49e4-8495-b2e2342abe2a\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"geography\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":2,\\\"format\\\":\\\"short\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Which Queensland island near Brisbane is the world's second largest sand island?\\\",\\\"decade\\\":\\\"1960s\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_0138T3DCi9tKSwsy7nFzdNWb\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":40,\\\"correct\\\":25,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.63},\\\"music\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":17,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.85},\\\"geography\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":12,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.6}},\\\"by_difficulty\\\":{\\\"2\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":60,\\\"correct\\\":44,\\\"corre…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01Vn85LPUAXkvNrNqYxYXqVJ\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"film\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":2},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"3b8aa975-e972-47ef-816f-d68c09d174c3\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"film\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":2,\\\"format\\\":\\\"choice\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Which Australian actress played Princess Diana in 'The Crown' and appeared in 'Tenet' (2020)?\\\",\\\"options\\\":[\\\"Eli…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01T3EkphpKdUQCnmLmsb9vTG\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":60,\\\"correct\\\":41,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.68},\\\"music\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":17,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.85},\\\"geography\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":12,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.6}},\\\"by_difficulty\\\":{\\\"2\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":80,\\\"correct\\\":60,\\\"corre…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_017AUnHDg3LW8yAtND7hY4Do\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"sport\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":3},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"75bde8e6-3e09-4794-829a-dcc646e0e1c5\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"sport\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":3,\\\"format\\\":\\\"short\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Which Australian cyclist won the Tour de France green jersey in 2002, 2003 and 2004?\\\",\\\"decade\\\":\\\"2000s\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01FTUs88Ze2GWwZVM5NtjKrT\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":60,\\\"correct\\\":41,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.68},\\\"music\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":17,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.85},\\\"geography\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":12,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.6},\\\"sport\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":11,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.55}…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_013LDwuJB7gPkebJwaEUvv9H\",\"name\":\"write\",\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"/workspace/memories/MEMORY.md\",\"content\":\"# Venue notes (Sydney, Australia; region `au`)\\n\\n- Country: Australia (Sydney). Use region `au`.\\n- Format: the last two nights were 6 rounds x 4 questions (triv…\"},\"result\":\"Successfully wrote to /workspace/memories/MEMORY.md\",\"error\":false}],\"plan\":\"That's all six rounds done. Notes are saved for next week.\\n\\n**Final standings**\\n1. Quizzly Bears: 19\\n2. The Blow-Ins: 17\\n3. Les Quizerables, Opera House Party and The Bondi Brainstormers: 15 each, tied\\n\\n**Rounds**\\n| Round | Genre | Difficulty | Correct |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| 1 | Film | 2 | 75% |\\n| 2 | Music | 2 | 85% |\\n| 3 | Film | 3 | 50% |\\n| 4 | Geography | 2 | 60% |\\n| 5 | Film | 2 | 80% |\\n| 6 | Sport | 3 | 55% |\\n\\nThe bank didn't relax any filter tonight. The wording of the round 4 Gold Coast question was garbled, so I clarified it aloud without changing what it asked.\\n\\n**Notes for next week**\\n- Start at difficulty 2. Difficulty 3 came out around 50–55% both times it was used.\\n- Film stays the favourite and music was strong.\\n- Science and history haven't been tried at difficulty 2 yet.\"}"
