"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01UVfeaxFQLxArvCCnJ6QJe8\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"music\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":11,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.55},\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":15,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.75},\\\"sport\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":13,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.65},\\\"science\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":12,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.6},\\\"…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_015Tdh68mH6kv55f54NQA85J\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"geography\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":2},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"c0190c4f-9679-49e4-8495-b2e2342abe2a\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"geography\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":2,\\\"format\\\":\\\"short\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Which Queensland island near Brisbane is the world's second largest sand island?\\\",\\\"decade\\\":\\\"1960s\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01KJeUWBNLaC3jezoQf3yQrG\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"music\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":11,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.55},\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":15,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.75},\\\"sport\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":13,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.65},\\\"science\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":12,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.6},\\\"…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01XkhwBKQGB7ewDv4xA7nGCd\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_scoreboard_f0fa1e7741\",\"arguments\":{\"scope\":\"tonight\"},\"result\":\"{\\\"scope\\\":\\\"tonight\\\",\\\"standings\\\":[{\\\"team\\\":\\\"Quizzly Bears\\\",\\\"points\\\":19},{\\\"team\\\":\\\"Les Quizerables\\\",\\\"points\\\":17},{\\\"team\\\":\\\"The Blow-Ins\\\",\\\"points\\\":15},{\\\"team\\\":\\\"The Bondi Brainstormers\\\",\\\"points\\\":14},{\\\"team\\\":\\\"Opera House Party\\\",\\\"points\\\":13}]}\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01QYSWJBC69MJD5MjzWzam1D\",\"name\":\"write\",\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"memories/MEMORY.md\",\"content\":\"# Venue notes\\n- Country: Australia (Sydney) -> use region `au`.\\n- Difficulty: difficulty 3 was too hard (55% right); difficulty 2 gave about 67%, which is the …\"},\"result\":\"Successfully wrote to memories/MEMORY.md\",\"error\":false}],\"plan\":\"All six rounds are done and the notes are saved for next week.\\n\\n**Final standings**\\n1. Quizzly Bears: 19\\n2. Les Quizerables: 17\\n3. The Blow-Ins: 15\\n4. The Bondi Brainstormers: 14\\n5. Opera House Party: 13\\n\\n**Rounds** (all region `au`)\\n\\n| Round | Genre | Difficulty | Correct |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| 1 | Music | 3 | 55% |\\n| 2 | Film | 2 | 75% |\\n| 3 | Sport | 2 | 65% |\\n| 4 | Science | 2 | 60% |\\n| 5 | History | 2 | 75% |\\n| 6 | Geography | 2 | 60% |\\n\\nRound 1 was under 58%, so I dropped to difficulty 2. Every later round landed inside the 58–75% band, so it stayed there.\\n\\n- **Week number:** the bank called tonight week 1, even though four teams had played here before.\\n- **Round 6, question 3:** the bank's wording was garbled, and I read it out as supplied.\\n- **Notes for next week:** I saved Australia as the region and difficulty 2 as the starting level. The six rounds of four were for tonight only, so I didn't save them as a standing preference.\"}"
          },
